6045487 13194139534223 17592186045417 true] [17592186414711 1071 "Which of the following is **not** a polyhedron?" 13194139534223 17592186045417 true] [17592186414711 1072 #uuid "60a685f7-2a5b-5185-bd48-1abde4b2de57" 13194139534223 17592186045417 true] [17592186414711 1074 "Each face in a polyhedron must be a polygon. Therefore, the only option that is **not** a polyhedron is:\n\n![](images/9b/9b094303688730cbd49075ad75faa3705e00999d40f253addfda88365991e401.png)\n\n    \n\nNotice that its left face is not a polygon (it's a circle)." 13194139534223 17592186045417 true] [17592186414712 1068 #edb/ref 17592186414708 13194139534223 17592186045417 true] [17592186414712 1069 "q-117697" 13194139534223 17592186045417 true] [17592186414712 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534223 17592186045417 true] [17592186414712 1071 "Which of the following is **not** a polyhedron?" 13194139534223 17592186045417 true] [17592186414712 1072 #uuid "8c22d74f-c382-5fcc-9b04-2bd8cc4168b4" 13194139534223 17592186045417 true] [17592186414712 1074 "Each face in a polyhedron must be a polygon. Therefore, the only option that is **not** a polyhedron is:\n\n![](images/0b/0bd12e1073334c21ebd437e103c55d166b4d433d0eec46787bb1906014c0c41d.png)\n\n              \n\nNotice that some of its faces are not polygons (they have curved sides)." 13194139534223 17592186045417 true] [17592186414713 1068 #edb/ref 17592186414709 13194139534223 17592186045417 true] [17592186414713 1069 "q-93195" 13194139534223 17592186045417 true] [17592186414713 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534223 17592186045417 true] [17592186414713 1071 "![](images/4b/4b5055d5290bfefa599d5fa357b76a3ccff05f9b0330c6610ce77deba949e34f.png)\n\nWhat is the name of the polyhedron shown above?" 13194139534223 17592186045417 true] [17592186414713 1072 #uuid "a6fd9de3-145f-5992-abae-ba4ddaa8590f" 13194139534223 17592186045417 true] [17592186414713 1074 "The solid is a **heptagonal pyramid** since it is a pyramid whose base is a heptagon.\n\nAlso,